": "ss2.png", "id": "421888538948247", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982542_421888542281580_7961047171456036679_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tUG-as4CQAAQ7kNvwHD2GZB&_nc_oc=AdqlGlKLtreoLA_a-MO85-bYGCdkr7vjzNf6ZmYlSMsPBnwlKTR6ku9wZRGTPlGKCJE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQKWQQE2EOzzipDRlA1uoe6cgOU58AIOsY0vFMlLtDp0w&oe=6B0718E2"}, {"file_name": "ss1.png", "id": "900672037137096", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57569452_900672040470429_3602208668542724751_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wInLIxGQjjsQ7kNvwH0EY9N&_nc_oc=AdrjOIo_McDKqBSIH3CGaTciSnvDDaflBgoQ2khN8SV0iLET-sT9EDmKr8XVqFzx-XQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTl_dYLuKaQpkgclqrcXkET5a3D9HyudXhN9JWs7MWGbA&oe=6B070036"}, {"file_name": "ss5.png", "id": "215595850179052", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036702_215595853512385_1516722769013058759_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7QuLnpWA8soQ7kNvwHyLE1r&_nc_oc=Ado5_HQ4DrxoJOE8gwv4Hsjus1kXmTcy-L6ODjc59caguTTC-ZQohMB1NGQRJATvZVA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTNoqtEexZOclnRoSxAzfNi6ViwzLkTBF8F7pF56r0mFg&oe=6B0707A4"}, {"file_name": "ss4.png", "id": "416146802772950", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982521_416146806106283_7161111592696257607_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NuK737fW9rQQ7kNvwGXEr8o&_nc_oc=AdoanDCC2PdFzbr3-rcOwallIl9pbbZHhh82nKr2XvlEw5Bc4xdYqr2TVWo1g-TNmZg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTnxxanc3LgXyeqPy_JS86n9j5AD84GBwdTQG03Wnadog&oe=6B072550"}, {"file_name": "ss7.png", "id": "512472986379303", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031547_512472989712636_7638735751378089066_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CIOvIjk8_u4Q7kNvwEE5xh_&_nc_oc=AdoLwiNvyqzul7OBGgKPenkMy7VmDN9uTKWbJ7baZRpAvasMkVwtKSlSHLnhxSc4Dkw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQPRkSPwzw57F9zxKMb62oq6cD7Dvjxey8XgPIhMJ50vg&oe=6B071FE1"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Counter Fight ICHIRAN", "keywords": ["ICHIRAN", "CounterFight", "JobSimulator", "Ramen", "cooking"], "long_description": "Make some mouth-watering ramen!\n\n\"Counter Fight ICHIRAN\" is an all-new cooking game created with input from popular ramen store, ICHIRAN.\n\nICHIRAN is a famous tonkotsu ramen chain with 85 outlets in Japan. Established over 60 years ago, it's been perfecting its hit specialty tonkotsu ramen for a long time, which is why ICHIRAN's ramen is the best in the land. In fact, it's often touted in the media as a \"must-try cuisine\" for foreign visitors.\n\nGame Features:\n\u30fbFulfill orders to get a high score! \nImmersive kitchen-based gameplay lets you experience life as a real ICHIRAN employee, racking up points for your ramen preparation skills and speedy delivery.\n\n\u30fbClimb the ranks in store management mode! \nYour score in store management mode is entered into a world ranking. Boost your profits to employ more staff and increase seating capacity as you try to hit the high scores with your own unique store!\n\n*In-game kitchen layout may differ from actual restaurants.", "short_description": "Cook some knockout noodles!\n\n\"Counter Fight ICHIRAN\" is an all-new cooking game made with input from popular ramen store, ICHIRAN.\n\nICHIRAN is a famous organic tonkotsu ramen chain with 85 outlets in Japan, often touted as a \"must-try cuisine\" for tourists. It has outlets in NY, Hong Kong, and Taiwan, too.\n\nFeatures:\n\u30fbFulfill orders to get a high score!\n\u30fbTake top place in store management mode!\n\u30fbBoost profits, employ more staff, up capacity, and hit the high scores with your own unique store!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "MiniLandscape.png", "id": "3838591046231584", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984462_3838591052898250_5002299579482394963_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-PUCWtoqPWkQ7kNvwHI0ZJr&_nc_oc=AdoyswnHmLrd5tZ92Hq7tVumBkwSBYpKS3bgyB5yW4gT11aclw1vdEN6rsx6wu8GnDA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRqmTdZFc610nQwIWh9a-CdJNBH_RuvZe1hn9ca4TOnCw&oe=6B070A9E"}, {"file_name": "CoverSquare.png", "id": "2182671695203710", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75641339_2182671698537043_1819436220465957851_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GIKXGk7DxVYQ7kNvwFR7j8E&_nc_oc=AdrT-XRrD65Nx5oc3fuhGUb6f9JphcVNitrLx1DMhztb4-dzVOYqPv8kmjn5erVSkvQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSad4unhumvyVSw1GDaTWB_m7kydMfyA_KanJhIIjRtVw&oe=6B07203B"}, {"file_name": "icon.png", "id": "446502446404480", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75476755_446502449737813_695504826495623275_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bD91g_pAkN4Q7kNvwFhyzlx&_nc_oc=AdoHxsbxWjxROxXiWPvi2m2adm5SvSG4zxo58PkP-zg7TQ7Cl52gjDfQolpnxUdgAVs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRHZIOFtThrmA54ohGLk6blpbEOUg8D7ZN8ud8VDfj47g&oe=6B070C61"}, {"file_name": "HeroCover.png", "id": "442920633578734", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75240108_442920636912067_8939691330164956004_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xWE34iNhjRQQ7kNvwEEQ4Vb&_nc_oc=AdomssPBYux7u5M5xETsD8Mh5Uyyh-XJQ7_Mi77MdfPMlHkamdfHpI2TAWh44IqYK8s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTyP_LXw6Dd0EqT6F77otJ6hfQqrNJCR4fT